  "intuition": "This loss encourages the model to minimize the cost gap between the preferred and less preferred options by comparing their log probabilities weighted by their cost difference, promoting preferences that reduce the cost gap. Using the log-sigmoid of the difference in log probabilities scaled by the cost gap effectively penalizes undesirable pairs and promotes better-ranking choices.",
